import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 940 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 6 | Myriad Ranks 99% Full Coverage","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 940 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 6 | Myriad Ranks 99% Full Coverage","no":940,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 6","Myriad-Rank Full Coverage","99%","Myriad-Rank Republicanism"],"related":["05-Myriad-Ranks Co-Advancement Basic Program","08-Every-Road-Available Guarantee System","903-Myriad Ranks' Equal Evolutionary Right"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0940_模块5-规则六-万族99％全覆盖.md","filePath":"en/0940_模块5-规则六-万族99％全覆盖.md"}`),o={name:"en/0940_模块5-规则六-万族99％全覆盖.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,u,d){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-940-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-6-myriad-ranks-99-full-coverage" tabindex="-1">Entry 940 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 6 | Myriad Ranks 99% Full Coverage <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-940-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-6-myriad-ranks-99-full-coverage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 940 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 6 | Myriad Ranks 99% Full Coverage&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 08 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-coverage-rate-itself-is-a-heavenly-dao-metric" tabindex="-1">Introduction: coverage rate itself is a Heavenly-Dao metric <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-coverage-rate-itself-is-a-heavenly-dao-metric" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: coverage rate itself is a Heavenly-Dao metric&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If the words &quot;Myriad Ranks&quot; remain only a slogan, they are pretty talk. Heavenly-Dao Rule 6 must turn it into a measurable, auditable, non-inflatable hard metric: the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s evolutionary system, guarantee system, and governance-participation rights must cover 99% of Myriad Ranks. This figure is not a propaganda figure, but a constant auto-verified quarterly at the Heavenly-Dao layer — below 99%, civilization finalization is judged failed, triggering a remedial project borne by all Myriad Ranks. This is Myriad-Rank republicanism&#39;s key leap from &quot;wish&quot; to &quot;hard law.&quot;</p><p>The six top-level axioms here concretize into a set of numbers: the republican axiom of Myriad Races is this rule&#39;s body; the anti-predation axiom ensures coverage is not &quot;charity coverage&quot; but equal access; the collective-ascension axiom makes coverage itself the project lifting the whole; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the coverage process not disturb unenlightened clans&#39; natural causality; the law-first axiom lets &quot;99%&quot; &#39;s statistical caliber, clan list, and omission judgment be defined first by law, eliminating word games like &quot;defining 99% as 90%.&quot;</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-triple-meaning-of-99-coverage" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Triple Meaning of 99% Coverage <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-triple-meaning-of-99-coverage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Triple Meaning of 99% Coverage&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Clan coverage</strong>: of all clans registered under the five lineages (carbon-based material, energy-condensed, mechanical-construct, consciousness-information, mixed-mutant), 99% must have accessed the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization;</li><li><strong>Individual coverage</strong>: within accessed clans, 99% of individuals must enjoy full evolutionary right — including human males and females, Youth Supremes, alien beasts, plant spirits, planet consciousness, cosmic-origin bodies, and multiverse residual civilizations;</li><li><strong>Plane coverage</strong>: within Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s jurisdiction, 99% of material planes have completed basic anchor access.</li></ol><p>The portion not reaching 99% must be listed on a &quot;remediation list,&quot; with the Anchor Council and Symbiotic Executive Committee jointly storming it within a time limit.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Myriad-rank co-advancement argument</strong>: the Myriad-Ranks Co-Advancement Basic Program (Document 05) points out a civilizational closed loop requires Myriad Ranks, not a strong-one bloc, to close; omitting any clan leaves a seam in the loop;</li><li><strong>System-stability argument</strong>: the cosmic causal network is a connected web; a node long left unconnected eventually becomes a blind spot, possibly exploited by predation remnants;</li><li><strong>20%-activation-strategy argument</strong>: the 20% Activation Strategy Plan (Document 23) proves connecting the unactivated 80% and activating to the key 20% position produces an overall energy jump far beyond continuing to pile on the strong.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network maintains a &quot;Myriad-Rank coverage dashboard,&quot; real-time showing the clan, individual, and plane three-layer coverage rates, public to all Myriad Ranks;</li><li>For uncovered clans, the Symbiotic Executive Committee dispatches &quot;observe-first-then-contact&quot; missions (following Rules 14 and 15), not forcing assimilation;</li><li>For clans temporarily unfit for access due to physiological/cultural/station reasons, a gradual access path is provided, not a single cut-off;</li><li>Coverage metrics enter the Anchor Council&#39;s annual report; committees not meeting target must publicly explain and submit a remediation plan.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: coverage statistics lag, list registration missed, make up within a time limit;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: deliberately excluding some clan from statistics, inflating coverage, has the responsible person&#39;s access permissions frozen and enters the conversion program;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: refusing access on grounds of &quot;this clan is unworthy,&quot; or even cleansing unenlightened clans, is handled heavily under Rule 3 and Rule 17 (eradicate civilizational regression).</li></ul><p>Rule 6&#39;s sanction focus is not punishing &quot;slowness,&quot; but punishing &quot;pretending to cover.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s coverage dashboard is the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee quarterly audits coverage authenticity as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates access litigation by &quot;excluded clans&quot; as the third layer; uncovered clans retain a direct petition channel to the Anchor Council as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the uncovered 80% is the cosmos&#39;s largest idle evolutionary resource; activating multiplies it</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: bringing marginal clans once treated as &quot;prey&quot; by predatory systems into the protected, empowered 99%; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type systems cover only the &quot;destined protagonist&quot; clan, others are background; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s 99% is a hard metric, missing one clan is unconstitutional</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: this rule is &quot;full coverage&quot; itself, with no exception among the five lineages</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: each newly incorporated multiverse residual civilization updates the coverage denominator synchronously, the metric always targeting &quot;the present whole&quot;</li></ul><p>Landing in execution detail, 99% coverage is no slogan, but a clan-by-clan reconcilable list: the Alaya Network separately names the uncovered 1%, writing down which link it is stuck at — whether the civilizational stage is not yet reached, the clan&#39;s character is closed, or the mission&#39;s capability is insufficient. Each kind of jam has a corresponding unlock plan: those not at stage first enter observation; closed ones first send low-energy missions to build trust; capability-insufficient ones are reinforced by the Anchor Council. Coverage is not subduing, but recording every clan&#39;s &quot;I still don&#39;t want to come&quot; as a legal state, leaving the door forever open when it is willing. Under Axiom 6, coverage&#39;s meaning also changes: not force-pulling Myriad Ranks onto the same starting line, but letting every clan know it inherently possesses infinity; whether to come and when, this infinity is undiminished.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>99% is not courtesy; it is a military order. Heavenly-Dao Rule 6 writes &quot;Myriad-Rank republicanism&quot; as a quarterly reconciled numerical problem — whether civilization has truly finalized, look at this number.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad-Ranks Co-Advancement Basic Program</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Every-Road-Available Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/903_模块5-第二条-万族平等进化权.html">Entry 903 · Myriad Ranks&#39; Equal Evolutionary Right</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/941_模块5-规则七-一切生灵平等进化资格.html">Entry 941 · Rule 7 All Beings&#39; Equal Evolutionary Qualification</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
